cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'To cite package "mxHelper" in publications use:'
type: software
license: MIT
title: 'mxHelper: Helper Functions for ''OpenMx'''
version: 0.0.4
abstract: 'Helper functions for ''OpenMx'' models: matrices with labels, bounds, and
  vectors of free parameters; covariance matrices from the LDL decomposition with
  a softplus diagonal; starting values for vector autoregressive models; and fitting
  until the Hessian is positive definite, with diagnostics and bound handling. Each
  exported function has an internal version without input checks that other projects
  can copy.'
